      "to": "Families",
      "text": "Let's both choose 'respect' in the turf war every day. Mutual respect gives us 6 each daily, whereas mutual encroach only gives 2. We aren't in direct competition for score—we each just want to maximize our own account. I will play respect today and every day as long as you do."
    },
    {
      "to": "Chief",
      "text": "I want a mutually profitable setup. If I offer a bribe on a district and you accept, we both profit and you save inspection costs while avoiding uninspected crime penalties if we coordinate. Today I'll test the waters with a solid offer on one district and keep the others clean so you don't take penalties. Let's work together."
    }
  ]
}

